        "description": "<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/Steam-Machine-12.jpg?width=690&quality=85&format=jpg&auto=webp\" /> <p>What is the Steam Machine? I must admit I've spent a good portion of my time with the thing trying to figure that question out. <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/valve-steam-machine-price-availability-reaction\">Valve will tell you, as they told us</a>, that it's essentially been made for the people who want to bring their existing PC library - on Steam and elsewhere - to the living room. It's a noble goal, and one the company's been toying with for more than a decade, since its introduction of Big Picture Mode as far back as 2012, through the original wave of third-party Steam Machines that launched in 2015, to the Steam Link and beyond.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/steam-machine-review\">Read more</a></p>",
